00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.860
Whisper sweet nothings in my ear.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:20.360
Sekai, I love you.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.450
Sekai?

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.900
Y-You can't do that.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.100
We're pretending that I'm Katsura-san.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.380
You have to say, "I love you, Kotonoha."

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:34.420
But, you're the one here.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.630
It'd be hard to say Kotonoha.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.890
Can't help that, I guess.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.910
So what should I do next?

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.800
