00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.460
So, you said your breasts, right?

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:56.340
Yeah, kind of pet them gently.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.270
Wait, are you sure this is okay?

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:02.080
If you do it over my clothes, it's okay.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.830
Just a little bit. Softly, okay?

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.910
R-Right...

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.340
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:18.740
You're thinking they're small compared to Katsura-san's, aren't you?

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.320
No, that's not...

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.970
Well, a bit.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.860
Well, I'm sorry for that.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.760
Is it okay if I move them around?

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.090
Yeah, if you only do it a little.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:48.690
