00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.130
I'm sorry.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.300
Are you sure?

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.520
Only because it's training.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:33.220
Message sent.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:44.210
Oh, I have to stop somewhere.

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:46.490
So you'll have to walk back yourself.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.510
See you tomorrow.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.300
