00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:02.540
You'll have to do the rest with Katsura-san.

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.430
Don't make a face like that.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.340
Jeez, get your act together.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:09.670
See you tomorrow.

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:10.410
Right.

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:27.800
Makoto-kun! Um, did you see my e-mail?

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:30.550
I'm sorry, I haven't looked at it yet.

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:33.650
