00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:42.070
No, me, too. I'm sorry for yesterday.

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:43.330
I'm sorry.

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:50.610
Since we've made up, do you want to go to a water park this Sunday?

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:52.820
